      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that, but honestly it's a bit short for our library requirements. the score for that was pretty low because of the length. \n\ncan you expand on this significantly? i need more depth—maybe dive into the wave-particle duality aspect, the mathematical derivation if possible, and how it differs from classical mechanics. i know i said no filler, but it really needs to be a massive, comprehensive breakdown to get a good score in the system. just make it much, much more in-depth.",
